# SSTI Detectie - Template engine identificatie
# Stap 1: Test of template injection mogelijk is
{{7*7}}
${7*7}
<%= 7*7 %>
#{7*7}
*{7*7}
# Stap 2: Engine identificeren via type coercion
# Jinja2/Twig: {{7*'7'}} -> '7777777' (Jinja2) of 49 (Twig)
# Freemarker: ${"freemarker"} -> freemarker (Java string)
# Pug: #{7*7} -> 49 (indentation-based syntax)
# Handlebars: {{this}} -> [object Object]
# ERB (Ruby): <%= 7*7 %> -> 49
# Stap 3: Beslisboom
# {{7*7}}=49 -> Jinja2 of Twig?
#   {{7*'7'}}='7777777' -> Jinja2 (Python)
#   {{7*'7'}}=49 -> Twig (PHP)
# ${7*7}=49 -> Freemarker (Java) of Smarty (PHP)?
#   ${"test"} werkt -> Freemarker
# #{7*7}=49 -> Pug/Jade (Node.js) of Ruby
